@startuml
title Candidate Data Transfer, Export, Retention, And Commercial Approval

state "Profile And CV Available\nContact And Export Blocked" as PreConfirmation
state "Commercial Approval Required" as CommercialApprovalRequired
state "Commercial Approval Recorded" as CommercialApprovalRecorded
state "Preparing Version-Bound Export" as PreparingExport
state "Export Preparation Failed" as ExportPreparationFailed
state "Ready For Transfer Confirmation" as ReadyForConfirmation
state "Transfer Confirmed" as TransferConfirmed
state "Contact And Customer Copy Available" as CustomerCopyAvailable
state "90-Day Retention Expired" as RetentionExpired
state "Candidate Content Disposed" as CandidateContentDisposed
state "Transfer Blocked" as TransferBlocked

[*] --> PreConfirmation : CandidateOpened

PreConfirmation --> CommercialApprovalRequired : StartTransfer\n[per-candidate contract]
PreConfirmation --> PreparingExport : StartTransfer\n[no commercial approval required]
PreConfirmation --> TransferBlocked : StartTransfer\n[not authorized or policy missing]

CommercialApprovalRequired --> CommercialApprovalRecorded : ApproveCandidateCommercially
CommercialApprovalRecorded --> PreparingExport : CommercialApprovalStored

PreparingExport --> ReadyForConfirmation : ExportPackagePrepared
PreparingExport --> ExportPreparationFailed : ExportPreparationFailed
ExportPreparationFailed --> PreparingExport : RetryExportPreparation

ReadyForConfirmation --> TransferConfirmed : ConfirmTransfer\n[authorized user and approved legal text]
TransferConfirmed --> CustomerCopyAvailable : PublishPreparedPackageAndContactData

CustomerCopyAvailable --> CustomerCopyAvailable : RetrySamePackageDownload\n[within 90 days]
CustomerCopyAvailable --> RetentionExpired : 90DaysElapsed
RetentionExpired --> CandidateContentDisposed : DeleteOrAnonymizePortalCopies

CandidateContentDisposed --> [*]
TransferBlocked --> [*]

note right of TransferConfirmed
Confirmation is the controller-transfer point,
independent of physical storage or download completion.
The idempotent record identifies customer, user,
candidate context, vacancy, CV/document version,
legal-text version, confirmation time, and export.
end note

note right of CustomerCopyAvailable
The same prepared export package remains available
for retry until the 90-day retention expiry.
end note

note right of CandidateContentDisposed
Dispose of candidate content, export packages,
derived copies, and search-index data. Keep only
legally approved minimized transfer evidence.
end note

note right of CommercialApprovalRequired
TODO: Confirm whether commercial approval creates
a billable event and how incidental/free candidates
are represented.
end note

note bottom
TODO: Approve final confirmation text and the exact
fields, audience, and retention term for minimized
transfer evidence before production.
end note

@enduml
